Bit 4: Counter overflow
Bit 6: Open circuit
Bit 7: Extrapolation stall
Bit 8: Input A
Bit 9: Input B
Bit 12: External latch input
Bit 13: Sync error
Bit 15: TxPDO toggle</string>
